WEBVTT

00:23:27.884 --> 00:23:31.904
including a flagship event in Doha 
at the end of the initiative,

00:23:31.904 --> 00:23:36.855
and to feature thinkers, researchers, 
artists, change-makers, entrepreneurs

00:23:36.855 --> 00:23:41.175
from across the Arab-speaking world.

00:23:41.545 --> 00:23:44.879
What are you personally 
most excited about in this partnership?

00:23:45.506 --> 00:23:49.296
Again, I think the Foundation 
has started doing a lot of work

00:23:49.296 --> 00:23:53.152
in trying to promote 
that entrepreneurship,

00:23:53.152 --> 00:23:55.324
so the Foundation 
started "Stars of Science,"

00:23:55.324 --> 00:24:01.246
where it attracts the young generation, 
entrepreneurs, innovators